@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-appearance README · 已验证快照：> **版本对应**：`0.3.x` 面向 DSH **`0.2.0-rc.2`**（官方桌面版内置的运行时）；`0.2.x` 面向 `0.1.1-rc.2`，在桌面版上无法激活。装之前先确认你的 DSH 版本，否则设置里不会出现「外观」。

发布目录的文件数和 SHA-256 树摘要记录在 [`integration/tested-snapshot.json`](integration/tested-snapshot.json)，可由脚本逐文件复核。

旧版 `host.js` / `prototype.client.js` 已移入 [`legacy-prototype/`](legacy-prototype/README.md)，仅用于历史参考。它只在浏览器内存中保存配置，不是推荐安装方式。

@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-appearance README · dsh-easy-appearance：> [!IMPORTANT]
> Version `0.2.0` is an official DSH Profile Bundle. Installation neither modifies nor rebuilds the official DSH source tree. This project is not an official DeepSeek release.

> Documentation images have been sanitized to remove real workspace names, paths, and conversations. They demonstrate the plugin's appearance; the running DSH version remains authoritative for exact controls.

@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-appearance README · Verification and development：- Profile Bundle contract: 3/3 tests passed;
- source appearance suite: 3 files and 8 tests passed;
- Host and client builds completed against the npm-published DSH `0.2.0-rc.2` packages (`npm install && npm run build`, no DSH source tree required);
- a real `.tgz` installed into an isolated Web profile through the official CLI; both the home page and client bundle returned HTTP 200;
- Host RPC discovered `ui-appearance` and returned the existing approximately 10.5 MB theme/wallpaper JSON intact;
- the test home's `cordis.patch.yml` digest was unchanged by installation, and theme/wallpaper state survived refresh and restart;
- the same profile passed browser and DSH Desktop embedded-page compatibility checks.
